VALUES ('doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p263-2', 'doc-14-nist-sp-800-53', '', 263, 'regulations include the specific name(s) of any system(s) of records that will be exempt, the specific provisions of the [PRIVACT] from which the system(s) of records is to be exempted, the reasons for the exemption, and an explanation for why the exemption is both necessary and appropriate.', 'kb-doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p263-2', 0, 47, '14-nist-sp-800-53', 'retrieved', '2F773980F18B13B1FB610D123B481E5E98548183B18F258E9DD88A3BA5B2EF1D', 'v1', '{"source_id": "14-nist-sp-800-53", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
