VALUES ('doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p269-2', 'doc-14-nist-sp-800-53', '', 269, 'to extract information related to analytic parameters and retrain the machine learning to classify malicious activity as benign. Accordingly, machine learning is augmented by human monitoring to ensure that sophisticated adversaries are not able to conceal their activities.', 'kb-doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p269-2', 0, 38, '14-nist-sp-800-53', 'retrieved', '8CFEF54E55BF07B250704F15CBE85D20C0646A7FE751FE75EDBBE535DCD0A3FF', 'v1', '{"source_id": "14-nist-sp-800-53", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
