VALUES ('doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p322-2', 'doc-14-nist-sp-800-53', '', 322, 'minimization, and modular decomposition to reduce and manage complexity. This produces software modules that are highly cohesive and loosely coupled.', 'kb-doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p322-2', 0, 20, '14-nist-sp-800-53', 'retrieved', '93576B9B9D0ABBC76F42A8D4798D7FDF5B11C40FC0C2D79E567A41D0922B263E', 'v1', '{"source_id": "14-nist-sp-800-53", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
