VALUES ('doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p352-15', 'doc-14-nist-sp-800-53', '', 352, 'Discussion: The implementation of cryptographic mechanisms to prevent the identification of wireless transmitters protects against the unique identification of wireless transmitters', 'kb-doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p352-15', 0, 21, '14-nist-sp-800-53', 'retrieved', '756C539DA370284FFFAC21EF041D22AB77694637117FF2AAEBEBB3C8442E4B07', 'v1', '{"source_id": "14-nist-sp-800-53", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
