VALUES ('doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p361-2', 'doc-14-nist-sp-800-53', '', 361, '(i.e., time frames) for taking corrective actions. Benchmarks can be established by the type of flaw or the severity of the potential vulnerability if the flaw can be exploited.', 'kb-doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p361-2', 0, 29, '14-nist-sp-800-53', 'retrieved', '925E975FA213393051C0417BE3CDDA5C44FDA9DE2E925EADBC67D4974E1DECA4', 'v1', '{"source_id": "14-nist-sp-800-53", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
