VALUES ('doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p372-2', 'doc-14-nist-sp-800-53', '', 372, 'Discussion: The use of automated mechanisms to support the management of distributed function testing helps to ensure the integrity, timeliness, completeness, and efficacy of such testing.', 'kb-doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p372-2', 0, 26, '14-nist-sp-800-53', 'retrieved', '78079901A95F38E8EFC3E94AACEEAA46579EFDC323C25F47AA149FC9E708DF86', 'v1', '{"source_id": "14-nist-sp-800-53", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
